-- Adds the "fm_submission" surface and the fm_* rule kinds to the compliance rule catalog
-- (portal pre-submission checks: NTE, deadlines, prohibited lines, attachments), then seeds the
-- ServiceChannel Managed starter pack as 'in_review'. Nothing is enforced until a reviewer approves.
